From 9ac53a18991e7e91f795bf7e61462c37cd6dec91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OrientCOMPASS <316423573+OrientCOMPASS@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:53:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] a2dp: aac: Backport the AAC sink decoder from pie

Add a2dp_aac_decoder.{h,cc}, backported from Android 9.  It wraps the
Fraunhofer decoder (aacDecoder_Open with TT_MP4_LATM_MCP1) which is
statically linked via libFraunhoferAAC -- already a system/bt dependency
in 8.1, so no new binary dependency is introduced.

Two deliberate deviations from the pie original, because 8.1 differs:
  * decoded_data_callback_t is defined in the header (8.1's
    a2dp_codec_api.h does not declare it);
  * a2dp_aac_decoder_decode_packet() takes (uint8_t* data, uint16_t len)
    instead of BT_HDR*, to fit 8.1's tBT_SBC_HDR-based sink queue.

Build wiring: add a2dp/a2dp_aac_decoder.cc to srcs and
external/aac/libAACdec/include to include_dirs in stack/Android.bp.
---
 stack/Android.bp                 |   2 +
 stack/a2dp/a2dp_aac_decoder.cc   | 114 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 stack/include/a2dp_aac_decoder.h |  54 +++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 170 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 stack/a2dp/a2dp_aac_decoder.cc
 create mode 100644 stack/include/a2dp_aac_decoder.h

